<title>UK: Border TV eyeing Sunderland City Radio.</title>
<headline>Border TV eyeing Sunderland City Radio.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Border Television Plc said on Monday it was in talks with Minster Sound Radio Plc about buying 100 percent of the issued ordinary share capital of Sunderland City Radio Ltd.</p>
</text>
